{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Chorus]\n[00:11.48] I've been waitin', I'm contemplatin'\n[00:14.10] Say you love me, girl, you were playin'\n[00:16.92] None of this gon' matter when we die\n[00:19.88] I won't wipe your tears, not when you cry\n[00:22.56] This ain't love, girl, this more like hatred\n[00:25.52] I've been down this road so many times before\n[00:28.22] Hoes in my phone, they're your replacement\n[00:30.84] But they feel nothin' like you, you made me whole\n[Verse 1]\n[00:34.72] I can't tell if this is a dream, am I awake or am I asleep?\n[00:39.88] I don't have answers, philosophies mean nothin' to me right now\n[00:45.66] And I can't tell if you were with me or against me\n[00:50.12] All my friends say you're Icky Vicky\n[00:52.82] I feel like Timmy, I'll keep on wishing\n[00:56.10] For better days, better days\n[00:58.56] Need some stronger pills, a better daze\n[01:01.46] I've been risking my life since you've been away\n[01:04.22] Tryna get your attention from far away\n[01:06.92] I've been having lucid dreams, stupid dreams\n[01:09.84] Thinkin' 'bout you and me, fluently\n[01:12.78] I've been experimentin' to take the pain away\n[01:16.08] Wake up thinkin' I heard your name\n[Chorus]\n[01:19.24] I've been waitin', I'm contemplatin'\n[01:21.86] Say you love me, girl, you were playin'\n[01:24.68] None of this gon' matter when we die\n[01:27.64] I won't wipe your tears, not when you cry\n[01:30.32] This ain't love, girl, this more like hatred\n[01:33.28] I've been down this road so many times before\n[01:35.98] Hoes in my phone, they're your replacement\n[01:38.66] But they feel nothing like you, you made me whole\n[Verse 2]\n[01:41.92] This is the part where I confess that most of my relations were toxic\n[01:47.26] Happiness will come when it's ready\n[01:50.08] Hold out your hands and embrace it with open arms\n[01:52.96] This is the part where I confess that toxic humans come off attractive\n[01:58.74] I made this song for anyone that's going through it, I'll clean up the mess\n[Interlude]\n[02:05.04] Yeah, na-na-na-na\n[02:06.80] Na-na-na-na\n[02:08.08] Na-na-na, na, na-na\n[02:10.92] Na-na-na-na\n[02:12.30] Na-na-na-na\n[02:13.92] Na-na-na, na-na-na\n[Bridge]\n[02:16.18] What's the matter?\n[02:18.28] Questions are unanswered\n[02:21.20] If you need some help, I'm a tweet away\n[02:24.28] Hit me today, hey\n[Chorus]\n[02:27.02] I've been waitin', I'm contemplatin'\n[02:29.62] Say you love me, girl, you were playin'\n[02:32.44] None of this gon' matter when we die\n[02:35.42] I won't wipe your tears, not when you cry\n[02:38.10] This ain't love, girl, this more like hatred\n[02:41.06] I've been down this road so many times before\n[02:43.74] Hoes in my phone, they're your replacement\n[02:46.36] But they feel nothin' like you, you made me whole\n[Outro]\n[02:49.64] But they feel nothin' like you, you made me whole","words":[[11.24,11.44,"[Chorus]"],[11.48,11.58,"I've"],[11.62,11.76,"been"],[11.82,12.4,"waitin',"],[12.7,12.76,"I'm"],[12.86,13.98,"contemplatin'"],[14.1,14.32,"Say"],[14.42,14.5,"you"],[14.64,14.92,"love"],[15.04,15.1,"me,"],[15.32,15.6,"girl,"],[15.74,15.82,"you"],[15.94,16.1,"were"],[16.14,16.76,"playin'"],[16.92,17.16,"None"],[17.24,17.34,"of"],[17.44,17.68,"this"],[17.78,18.02,"gon'"],[18.12,18.6,"matter"],[18.8,18.94,"when"],[19.06,19.16,"we"],[19.38,19.7,"die"],[19.88,19.88,"I"],[19.94,20.2,"won't"],[20.28,20.54,"wipe"],[20.62,20.78,"your"],[20.9,21.22,"tears,"],[21.3,21.52,"not"],[21.62,21.76,"when"],[21.86,21.96,"you"],[22.14,22.48,"cry"],[22.56,22.78,"This"],[22.88,23.04,"ain't"],[23.1,23.34,"love,"],[23.42,23.66,"girl,"],[23.78,24.0,"this"],[24.1,24.28,"more"],[24.36,24.6,"like"],[24.66,25.18,"hatred"],[25.52,25.58,"I've"],[25.64,25.82,"been"],[25.92,26.18,"down"],[26.26,26.48,"this"],[26.6,26.86,"road"],[26.92,27.02,"so"],[27.12,27.32,"many"],[27.5,27.78,"times"],[27.84,28.16,"before"],[28.22,28.5,"Hoes"],[28.58,28.64,"in"],[28.72,28.92,"my"],[29.04,29.34,"phone,"],[2